<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fresh loins $3.00 higher in very light test; butts steady to weak; skinned hams steady to 2.00 lower; seedless bellies 2.00 higher in a light test; lean trimmings 1.00 lower. Trading very slow, with light demand and mostly moderate immediate offerings. -USDA</p>
